Exercise 1: Format Today's Date
Suppose we are building an application that need to display today's date
to users in a readable format such as: 16-03-2026
Instead of showing the default Java format we want to format the date in day-month-year format.

Exercise 2: Handling Missing Data Safely
Imagine we are building a user profile system here a user's phone number
may or may not be available
If the phone number is missing, we want to display a default message instead of null.

Exercise 3: Validating Required Data
Suppose our application requires a username to be provided.
If the username is missing, the program should immediately throw an error
instead of continuing with invalid data.